        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi gi Bathseba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.20.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kigana 20:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo ma oro, ma kerin jomaro kidh'iye i lweny, Daudi ooro Yowab kodi jotel pa jolweny pere kodi jolweny ma Isiraili gibe; aka jokengila Joamon. To Daudi k'okadho i lweny, go odoŋ Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel, i hongo m'othieno, Daudi oay i kanindo pere aka oidho malo ma ot pere. Munyo go wotho idho malo, oneno dhako moro lwokere. Dhako no oyido ŋon swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi to oro jamikwenda moro niaŋ kwoŋ ŋata dhako no obedo; aka onwaŋere ni manago oyido Bathseba nyar Eliam, aka cipa Uriya Jahiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ooro jomikwenda omo Bathseba, jokelo go bonge to Daudi nindo gine (Bathseba oyido nyaka otieko ruko dwe.) Kenyo go odok peco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen mere, Bathseba oniaŋ ni ogamo iye, aka odhiro wac ri Daudi miyo go ŋeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi odhiro wac ri Yowab ni, “Dhiri ran Uriya Jahiti.” Ameno Yowab bende odhiro Uriya bongi Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Uriya otundo bongi Daudi, Daudi openjo go k'inen Yowab gi jolweny oyido jober, kodi nger ma lweny oyido medere iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Daudi owaco ri Uriya ni, “Dok peco iywomere ma hongo moro.” Uriya oeye bongi Daudi, aka Daudi odhiro ri peco pere mic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Uriya k'odok peco; okidho to nindo i waŋkac ma peco pa kere gi jokur pa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Daudi owinjo ni Uriya k'onindo peco pere, openjo Uriya ni, “Nyaka idwoko m'oyido ikibedi gi cegin; to raŋo ikidoki peco?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya odwoko ni, “Cwo ma Isiraili gi Yuda jonitie i lweny, aka Kakan ma Cikirok pa Were nitie bongi jo; aka jadwoŋ paran Yowab jamituka jolweny kodi jotel pa jolweny jotimo kambi i sa kam'othangere. Anonyal nedi dok peco cemo gi medho, t'anindo gi dhako paran? Paka ikwo aka doko paka cunyin kwo, akibino timo gigipiny me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Daudi owaco rigo ni, “Doŋ ka konon, aka dikin abino dhirin igiki i lweny.” Ameno Uriya obedo Yerusalem ndelo no gi yawere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudi olwoŋo go cemo othieno, ocemo to medho aka omer. To doko wor no Uriya k'odok peco pere; kwanyo woko onindo i par pere bongi jokur pa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawere odikin, Daudi ondiko balwa ri Yowab, aka omiyo Uriya ni woter rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I balwa no Daudi ondiko ni, “Kethi Uriya yuwiye kama lweny lieth'iye swa, k'itieko timo ameno, ringi t'iweyo woneki go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno munyo Yowab oyido mako tindi madwoŋ, odhiro Uriya kama jokwor oyido jolweny'iye matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokwor pa Joisiraili jowok i tindi madwoŋ, aka jolwenyo gi cwo pa Yowab; jotel pa jolweny pa Daudi megi jotho, aka kiri Uriya je oneki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yowab ooro jamikwenda bongi Daudi waco rigo gima mako kwoŋ lweny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka ociko go ni, “K'itieko waco ri kere wac ma mako kwoŋ lweny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go nyalo mako nge to penjin ni, ‘Raŋo wicore cegin gi tindi madwoŋ lweny gi jo? Oyido wikiŋey ni jonyalo bolo aserin gi kor ot? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.9.53"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jothum 9:53",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikipoy nger ma Abimelek wod pa Gideon onek'iye? Obedo i Thebez ma dhako moro obolo tele piny gi kor ot to neko go. Raŋo to wicore cegin gi kor ot?’ Ka kere openjin ameno, wac rigo ni, ‘Jatel pa jolweny perin Uriya bende otho.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamikwenda no obino bongi Daudi, aka owaco rigo gima Yowab ooro go gine ni wowaci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamikwenda no owaco ri Daudi ni, “Jokwor mawan oyido jotek loyo wan, jowok i tindi madwoŋ to jobino lweny gi wan kam'othangere, to wariemo jo kiri i waŋkac ma tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jobolo aserin gi kor ot, to megi kwoŋ jotel pa jolweny perin jotho; kiri Uriya je oneki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
