        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco ri jamikwenda no ni, “Waci ri Yowab ni wokiri worembi, rupiri k'ikidho i lweny ikinyal ŋeyo ni ŋa ma latho. Waci rigo womonji tindi madwoŋ aka womaki.”",
